      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$= 2 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times 4\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi rl = 4\\pi(3)^2 + 2\\pi \\times 3 \\times 9 = 90\\pi = 282.74  বর্গ সে.মি. (প্রায়)$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
