      "kind": "text",
      "section": "সমাধান:",
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ গোলকের ফাঁপা অংশের আয়তন $= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3 = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi \\times (5.5)^3 = 696.9116$ ঘন সে.মি.\n(প্রায়)",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3 = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi \\times (5.5)^3 = 696.9116"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 307,
      "pdfPageEnd": 307,
      "printedPageStart": 302,
      "printedPageEnd": 302,
      "reviewReasons": [
